; expect 42
; The builtin `Option`. It has no declaration for the codegen type
; registry to walk, so `Some`/`None` were absent from it entirely: the
; match bound nothing and emitted `store i64 %x` naming a register
; that does not exist, which llc refused. `Some` is tag 0 and `None`
; tag 1 (probed against stage0), and the pair is `mixed` - `None` an
; immediate, `Some` a heap block.
(:: main Int)

(fn (main)
  (match (Some 42)
    ((Some x) x)
    ((None) 0)
  )
)
